a dialog opens with item details to edit. add image also to item\\\"\\n  - \\\"remove item category ppc opc and bay\\\"\\n  - \\\"take screenshot, dialog is hidden behind keyboard\\\"\\n  - \\\"working. you can remove grade and brand name from edit and short form of item from tile\\\"\\n\\n### 3. Work Accomplished\\n- **Environment Setup**: Verified the `run_tests.sh` and `build_apk.sh` scripts work. Successfully connected to the device via ADB (`adb connect 10.106.186.46:41311`) and established a deployment loop.\\n- **Added Edit Item Feature**:\\n  - Appended `imageUrl` property to `CementProduct` in `Models.kt`.\\n  - Added `updateProduct` function in `CementStockRepositoryImpl.kt` and `CementStockRepository.kt`.\\n  - Added `updateProduct` JSON handler to the `AndroidBridge` interface in `MainActivity.kt`.\\n  - Implemented `editItemModal` in `index.html`. Added a debounced long-press handler (`touchstart` + `contextmenu`) to the product tiles that swaps the tile content for a large edit pencil.\\n- **UI Cleanups**:\\n  - Removed \\\"PPC/OPC/Specialty\\\" category filter pills from the POS screen in `index.html`.\\n  - Removed \\\"Grade\\\" and \\\"Bay Location\\\" displays from the product tiles.\\n- **Fixed Keyboard Overlap Bug**:\\n  - Set `android:windowSoftInputMode=\\\"adjustResize\\\"` in `AndroidManifest.xml`.\\n  - Updated `MainActivity.kt`'s `setOnApplyWindowInsetsListener` to apply `insets.systemWindowInsetBottom` to the layout padding (it was previously discarding the keyboard inset).\\n  - Added `max-h-full overflow-y-auto` to the modals in `index.html` to allow them to scroll when the keyboard consumes screen space.\\n- **Recent Edits**: Removed `editItemBrand` and `editItemGrade` inputs from the edit modal HTML and JS submission logic (`openEditItemModal`/`saveEditItem`). By excluding them from the update payload, the Kotlin backend preserves their existing values.\\n\\n### 4. Model Knowledge\\n- **Architecture**: The app uses a hybrid architecture. `MainActivity.kt` hosts a WebView loading `file:///android_asset/index.html`. State is managed in Kotlin via `CementStockRepositoryImpl.kt` (using Flow/MutableStateFlow), and the frontend communicates via Javascript interfaces (`@JavascriptInterface inner class AndroidBridge`).\\n- **Event Handling Quirks**: \\n  - Android WebViews natively fire an `oncontextmenu` event during a long press. This was conflicting with custom `touchstart` timers, causing double-triggers. A 300ms debounce (`lastToggleTime`) was implemented in `index.html` to resolve this.\\n  - Using `setOnApplyWindowInsetsListener` on a `FrameLayout` consumes window insets. To make `adjustResize` work in this environment, the `systemWindowInsetBottom` must be explicitly passed into the root view's bottom padding.\\n- **ADB Quirks**: The Wireless ADB connection occasionally drops (\\\"device offline\\\"). Restarting the ADB server (`adb kill-server && adb start-server`) and reconnecting resolves it.\\n\\n### 5. Files and Code\\n**Edited Files**:\\n- `/data/data/com.termux/files/home/bhpos/app/src/main/java/com/example/bhpos/domain/model/Models.kt`: Added `imageUrl: String? = null` to `CementProduct`.\\n- `/data/data/com.termux/files/home/bhpos/app/src/main/java/com/example/bhpos/data/repository/CementStockRepository.kt` & `.../CementStockRepositoryImpl.kt`: Added `suspend fun updateProduct(product: CementProduct): Result<Unit>`.\\n- `/data/data/com.termux/files/home/bhpos/app/src/main/AndroidManifest.xml`: Added `android:windowSoftInputMode=\\\"adjustResize\\\"`.\\n- `/data/data/com.termux/files/home/bhpos/app/src/main/java/com/example/bhpos/MainActivity.kt`: \\n  - Updated JS `AndroidBridge` to serialize `imageUrl` and parse updates via `updateProduct()`.\\n  - Modified `rootLayout.setOnApplyWindowInsetsListener` to pass `insets.systemWindowInsetBottom` into the bottom padding.\\n- `/data/data/com.termux/files/home/bhpos/app/src/main/assets/index.html`: \\n  - Heavily modified. Added `editItemModal`